                <pb facs="0569" n="497" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg497"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5931/491.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the United
                            States to the Shah of
                    Persia.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I tender your majesty congratulations on the opening of the constitutional
                    parliament. The American people wish welfare and peace for Persia under the new
                    order of things.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
